o. When things go awry they're forced to hijack a city bus.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1075334,\"title\":\"The Girl Who Escaped: The Kara Robinson Story\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/o9hwOE1FeOelkNxfsGtTNrlWnyq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7SkhcQYU8mxGGCbmRbqOf6UFIuE.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Based on a true story. 15-year-old Kara Robinson was kidnapped, assaulted and held captive for 18 hours. With her survival instincts kicking in, she plots a daring escape from the serial killer and leads police to his apartment.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":550776,\"title\":\"Believe Me: The Abduction of Lisa McVey\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qbJEzCzEKDHPZDiRvSSBiYEKaAH.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gPW90IPq6Go8hlT0n7Es3cFl7ly.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"On the night she plans on taking her own life, 17-year-old 'Lisa McVey' is kidnapped and finds herself fighting to stay alive and is raped. She manages to talk her attacker into releasing her, but when she returns home, no one believes her story except for one detective, who suspects she was abducted by a serial killer. Based on horrifying true events.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"TV Movie\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":363992,\"title\":\"The Wizard of Lies\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8k4lJ4e0hvDQtKpItXmmPdw69sO.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ims0V4WEUYt6JgfvPIyH9G79q40.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A look behind the scenes at Bernie Madoff's massive Ponzi scheme, how it was perpetrated on the public and the trail of destruction it left in its wake, both for the victims and Madoff's family.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":336845,\"title\":\"Cleveland Abduction\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/j2iCc5fjyJvKRQAW7d6XWwDFzmr.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lG8T8NMJHfBgxvobVBMy0rFR2OM.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A single mother becomes Ariel Castro's first kidnapping victim, and finds herself trapped in his home with two other women for 11 years.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"TV Movie\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":361263,\"title\":\"Jesse Stone: Lost in Paradise\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gw5ax5lElk0G1MRDFIQT4V8xUZU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4xAYXf0seFqQqItJ5qx20w78FlU.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Police Chief Jesse Stone now presides over the quiet, seaside village of Paradise, Massachusetts. When the facts don't add up in a brutal Boston-area murder case, Jesse opens an investigation filled with surprises, unlikely suspects and grave danger. Though it's widely believed the murder was committed by an incarcerated serial killer, Jesse suspects another killer is at large and is hell-bent on bringing him to justice.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"TV Movie\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":436398,\"title\":\"Dead Over Heels: An Aurora Teagarden Mystery\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/p6TUrrWS9R2pNGRw7NMw2cyLqkv.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nyiE2ZAtgAAWscwK2mxstTt9Hri.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Librarian and real crime buff Aurora “Roe” Teagarden never liked Detective Sergeant Jack Burns, but she also never wanted to see him dead. When his body is found outside of Aurora’s home, she then becomes  the main suspect. Determined to find the killer and clear her name, Aurora can't help but to get  involved once again.\",\"genres\":[\"Mystery\",\"TV Movie\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":339580,\"title\":\"Real Murders: An Aurora Teagarden Mystery\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rRILgctGqBniagwY4roJF158fDm.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/y4DhUdR5EqInh4PuWcZgVPjjR7r.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Aurora finds a member of her crime buff group, the Real Murders Club, killed in a manner that eerily resembles the crime the club was about to discuss. As other brutal \\\"copycat\\\" killings follow, Aurora will have to uncover the person behind the terrifying game.\",\"genres\":[\"Mystery\",\"TV Movie\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":800425,\"title\":\"Ray Donovan: The Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5sw1EvOeXMGRZGWr18R4EiZs036.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tUYotMWdNGXtH22cs7p3a7c19PS.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A showdown decades in the making brings the Donovan family legacy full circle. As the events that made Ray who he is today finally come to light, the Donovans find themselves drawn back to Boston to face the past. Each of them struggles to overcome their violent upbringing, but destiny dies hard, and only their fierce love for each other keeps them in the fight.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":359305,\"title\":\"An Inspector Calls\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qZLDqf9poquJwY5uY6ZWK1yqsSb.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/x7i70dfvEXuV6o7nN9J8P4KCM6K.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Northern England, 1912. The dinner of a wealthy family is interrupted by Inspector Goole, who only announces that a young woman has committed suicide. Then, he simply asks everyone present, one by one, if they knew her.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Crime\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":291081,\"title\":\"Red Riding: The Year of Our Lord 1974\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1MGUwUFkcAKawdsT2q88Sdo2vv6.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cK4zqgIXBFWoaQ5Kmz8GdyHApIv.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Yorkshire, 1974. Fear, mistrust and institutionalised police corruption are running riot. Rookie journalist Eddie Dunford is determined to search for the truth in an increasingly complex maze of lies and deceit surrounding the police investigation into a series of child abductions. When young Clare Kemplay goes missing, Eddie and his colleague, Barry, persuade their editor to let them investigate links with two similar abductions that draw them into a deadly world of secrecy, intimidation, shocking revelations and police brutality.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Mystery\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"mFSTNp9Zos8\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"pipH8MUJsfM\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"ZBvK6ni97W8\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}